# For keeping this context folder as its own private git repo, which `./sweatcast backup`
# commits and pushes after each workout (README, "Back up me/"). Everything else is kept:
# profile, health, log, drafts, research, and your coaches with their measured pace.

# Rendered clips: large, and any build makes them again. The measured pace stays.
workouts/.audio-cache/*
!workouts/.audio-cache/voice-pace.json
# MP3s go to the delivery folder; render logs are per build (builds.jsonl stays).
*.mp3
# A workout's web copy (Claude Code on the web) is kept: the private repo is how it reaches you.
!*.web-*.mp3
# Each web coach's approved sample is kept (archived ones too); auditions in progress, and a
# make between saving a voice and writing the coach, are not.
!coaches/*/sample.mp3
!coaches/.archive/*/sample.mp3
coaches/.auditions/
coaches/*/.made.json
coaches/*/.made.wav
workouts/.logs/*.log
# Stock-voice samples, and ./sweatcast migrate's backups (git has the history).
coaches/.samples/
.backup-*/
*.lock
.DS_Store
# API keys for cloud voices (./sweatcast keys): never committed, never pushed.
.env
